  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given a grid of size N×MN \\times MN×M containing all integers from 111 to N×MN \\times MN×M, each exactly once.\n\nThe grid is represented as ai,ja_{i,j}ai,j​ for 1≤i≤N1 \\le i \\le N1≤i≤N and 1≤j≤M1 \\le j \\le M1≤j≤M, where iii denotes the row index and jjj denotes the column index.\n\nDefine the **beauty** of the grid as the maximum integer XXX (1≤X≤N∗M+11 \\le X \\le N*M+11≤X≤N∗M+1) such that it is possible to sort the grid into the following form:\n\n12⋯MM+1M+2⋯2M⋮⋮⋱⋮(N−1)M+1(N−1)M+2⋯N×M\\begin{matrix}\n1 &amp; 2 &amp; \\cdots &amp; M \\\\\nM+1 &amp; M+2 &amp; \\cdots &amp; 2M \\\\\n\\vdots &amp; \\vdots &amp; \\ddots &amp; \\vdots \\\\\n(N-1)M+1 &amp; (N-1)M+2 &amp; \\cdots &amp; N \\times M\n\\end{matrix}1M+1⋮(N−1)M+1​2M+2⋮(N−1)M+2​⋯⋯⋱⋯​M2M⋮N×M​using the operation described below **any number of times**.\n\nYou may choose any two positions (i,j)(i,j)(i,j) and (k,ℓ)(k,\\ell)(k,ℓ) and swap ai,ja_{i,j}ai,j​ with ak,ℓa_{k,\\ell}ak,ℓ​ **if and only if**\n\n(∣i−k∣+1)⋅(∣j−ℓ∣+1)≥X(\\lvert i-k\\rvert + 1)\\cdot(\\lvert j-\\ell\\rvert + 1) \\ge X(∣i−k∣+1)⋅(∣j−ℓ∣+1)≥XIt can be proved that it is always possible to choose some XXX (1≤X≤N∗M+11 \\le X \\le N*M+11≤X≤N∗M+1) , such that grid becomes sorted using the operations.\n\nYour task is to compute the beauty of the given grid.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line contains a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nFor each test case:\n\nThe first line contains two integers NNN and MMM — the number of rows and columns of the grid.\nThe next NNN lines each contain MMM space-separated integers, describing the grid.\n\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output a single integer — the beauty of the grid.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1041 \\le T \\le 10^41≤T≤104",
      "1≤N,M≤2⋅1051 \\le N, M \\le 2 \\cdot 10^51≤N,M≤2⋅105",
      "The grid contains all integers from 111 to N×MN \\times MN×M exactly once.",
      "The sum of N×MN \\times MN×M over all test cases does not exceed 2⋅1052 \\cdot 10^52⋅105."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
